WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:03.203
Be still, and know that I am God.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.340
Let distracting thoughts pass rather than chasing them.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:12.786
You do not have to solve every feeling or hurry toward a spiritual experience.

00:00:12.786 --> 00:00:15.934
Receive whatever stillness is available.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:20.098
Focus on the divine Father, approached through Jesus.

00:00:20.098 --> 00:00:25.209
Present your needs, your calling, and your daily practices to God.

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:31.936
Tell Him what you hope for, what you fear, and what you are trying to do with the life He has given you.

00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:36.184
Receive God’s presence without trying to manufacture it.

00:00:36.184 --> 00:00:43.301
Quiet distraction, receive comfort, and let this time become a small faithful practice of attention.

00:00:43.301 --> 00:00:46.909
You are not required to feel a particular way.

00:00:46.909 --> 00:00:53.093
Let grace reshape your attention, and receive the peace that is already present in Christ.

00:00:53.093 --> 00:00:54.931
Now listen.
